@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Added ``beacons.list_status`` to report, per configured beacon, when it last
+actually executed and whether that run raised an error. The status is
+updated live as beacons fire, so it does not require waiting for a new
+probe cycle, reading minion logs, or restarting the minion. Beacons that
+have not yet run report ``last_run: None``.
